Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}You wake up.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.93,0:00:02.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}You sense someone in the room.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}You try to move... nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}That can be sleep paralysis.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.89,0:00:07.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Awareness returns while
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.10,0:00:10.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}REM sleep's muscle\Nstillness briefly continues.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.97,0:00:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Dreamlike sights\Nor chest pressure
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.41,0:00:14.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}can feel real.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.72,0:00:15.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Breathing continues.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.19,0:00:17.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}If you feel it starting,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}remind yourself it passes.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Relax, and try
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}one tiny finger movement.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.25,0:00:22.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}It may help.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}There's no guaranteed\Noff switch.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Regular sleep may\Nreduce episodes.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.76,0:00:28.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}If it keeps happening
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.83,0:00:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}or leaves you very sleepy,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}talk to a clinician.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.95,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}AWAKE.\NCAN'T MOVE.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.90,0:00:10.97,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\pos(360,800)}AWARENESS RETURNS\NREM STILLNESS LINGERS
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.20,0:00:19.40,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\pos(360,200)}TEMPORARY. IT PASSES.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.27,0:00:25.13,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\pos(360,220)}MAY HELP\NNO GUARANTEED OFF SWITCH
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.13,0:00:27.77,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\pos(360,185)}REGULAR SLEEP
